{"parse": {"title": "FT-08", "pageid": 55363, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-07\" title=\"FT-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-09\" title=\"FT-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.99.9A.E7.A5.B7.E7.9A.84.E5.8F.AE.E5.98.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"晚祷的叮嘱\">晚祷的叮嘱</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 晚祷的叮嘱</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Warning at Dinner</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>乖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>狗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>狗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>骸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>骨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>应淌的鲜血，应亡的亵渎者……诸位的奉献，已尽收入我的眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>绿椅子罗杰、小瘟疫迈耶……以及我们的人类兄弟——死人莱格斯先生，欢迎你们莅临“受苦者”的殿堂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">裹布中的人：</div><div>呃……唔！呜呜呜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>角落的笼子中，团状的裹布渗出红色，传来含糊不清的呜咽声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他走入阴影，温柔地抚摸着这颤抖的躯体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-625901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-625901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-625901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>嘘……嘘，瞧，多缺礼数——你打扰了我们宝贵的宴席，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笼子顷刻间陷入了死寂……但那因瑟瑟发抖而响起的磕碰声却仍断断续续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-625910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-625910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-625910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>很好很好，保持安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他撤身离开了笼子，将双手搭在绿椅子罗杰的肩膀之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>兄弟姊妹们……你们所拢集的财富，与吸纳的神秘学家子嗣，为“受苦者”的复苏庆典作出了崇高的奉献。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我们的信徒日渐虔诚，我也为此满心欢喜——可欢愉遍地，悲恸与憎恶却仍不止息！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>——就在昨日，有两名擅入者破坏了降下启示的仪式，并窃走了一把通往“乐园”的钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>那是“受苦者”苦痛的牺牲前，留予我们何其珍贵的、与世隔绝的“乐园”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>你们理应知晓，钥匙之事不应泄露。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寂静，漫长的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿椅子罗杰：</div><div>您、您可以将这位泄密者交给我！绿椅子的酷刑能为您撕开他胸膛里的秘密，并把告密者的血肉都还予您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>哈哈哈……多么讨喜的兄弟，我的罗杰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>但不、不，我不需要你的帮助，子嗣们已凿尽了他的肺腑，发现他那可怜的胸膛中并无半点秘密——这只是一位虔诚但冒失的同袍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我只是以此告诫诸位，献予“受苦者”的复苏庆典在即，我一直关切子嗣们的一举一动——你们并不孤独，亦不特殊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>此刻，这位泄露了秘密的同袍——敲铃人，正在你们眼前……告诉我，你们谁想给予他最后一丝怜悯与施舍？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他晃悠着笼子的钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">裹布中的人：</div><div>呃呜呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默不语的莱格斯，俯身站起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笼子的门被打开，颤抖的肉块跌落在地，蛆虫般在地上扭动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>吁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-626201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-626201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-626201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">异种格拉瓦库斯：</div><div>嘶……嘁嘁嘁嘁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两只影子般的生物，翻过天花板的吊灯，从墙上如同蜘蛛般爬了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>把他带走，孩子们……拖得远一些，吃干抹净，别为尊敬的先生留下血污。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>魔精撕咬着裹布，将肉块拖行着，在地毯上留下一道血痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是将猎物带回巢穴的蛛类，它们流着口涎，与撕心裂肺的嚎叫一同消失在了黑暗里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>谢谢你，莱格斯先生……诸位，就座吧，请享用这场难得的盛宴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宴席结束，多余的宾客已经散去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>……莱格斯，你最晚与我们同座，所尽的贡献却远甚于其他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>可如今，孩子，是什么遮蔽了你的双目，绊住了你的脚步？……你对新纪元集市失去控制，已将我们陷于窘境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>连同圣洛夫基金会也肆意游荡，把你的领地当作了后花园。莱格斯，你的威信已在诸位当中竭尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>这是一次劝诫，莱格斯，庆典已近，我们并没有太多耐心——把钥匙拿回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……是的，我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>使徒以手帕擦了擦嘴角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>现在，庆典所需的一切事务虽已齐备，但我们在虔诚的子嗣当中，仍未找寻到一个真正能够担任祭司之职的灵性者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我们需要一位真正的祭司——他需得指引着子嗣超脱，带领他们抛却尘世的束缚，真正与“受苦者”融为一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>——你明白这意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>这是我亲授的使命，不容许第三个人知晓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>去为我们，也为你自己，寻觅一位合适的祭司，莱格斯。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-08"}}